      <div class="yp-content">
        <div class="yp-card">
          <div class="yp-cond">
            <div class="yp-cond-formal">You must report to your supervising officer as and when required to do so.</div>
            <div class="yp-means-lbl">What this means</div>
            <div class="yp-cond-plain">Go to your YOT appointment every time you're asked. Missing it could send you back.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="yp-cond">
            <div class="yp-cond-formal">You must not commit any offence.</div>
            <div class="yp-means-lbl">What this means</div>
            <div class="yp-cond-plain">Any crime, even a small one, could mean you go straight back inside. Stay out of trouble.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="yp-cond">
            <div class="yp-cond-formal">You must reside permanently at an address approved by your supervising officer.</div>
            <div class="yp-means-lbl">What this means</div>
            <div class="yp-cond-plain">You must sleep at your approved address every night. If you want to move, speak to your worker first.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="yp-cond">
            <div class="yp-cond-formal">You must be of good behaviour and not behave in a way which undermines the purpose of your licence.</div>
            <div class="yp-means-lbl">What this means</div>
            <div class="yp-cond-plain">Keep your head down. Be respectful, avoid drama, and show you're serious about making changes.</div>
